{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"45341","pref":"宮崎県","city":"三股町","display_comment":"三股町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では鶴田任男に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「椎八重公園」や「かくれ念仏洞」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","layer_counts":{"cafe_restaurant":1,"public_facilities":29,"scenic_nature_areas":2,"cultural_facilities":20,"parks_playgrounds":18,"tourism_resources":1},"total_features":71,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"cafe_restaurant","name":"スーパーセンタートライアル三股店","category":"food","address":"宮崎県北諸県郡三股町大字樺山４８３４番３","source":"厚生労働省 食品衛生申請等システム（オープンデータ）","municipality_code":"45341","municipality_pref":"宮崎県","municipality_name":"三股町","municipality_code_method":"food_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.105371,31.734229]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"中原地区コミュニティセンター","category":"public","address":"三股町大字樺山5023","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"45341","municipality_pref":"宮崎県","municipality_name":"三股町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.107861,31.737217000000005]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"第２地区分館","category":"public","address":"三股町樺山2724-91","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"45341","municipality_pref":"宮崎県","municipality_name":"三股町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.128048,31.723756]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"轟木集落センター","category":"public","address":"三股町大字長田6439-1","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"45341","municipality_pref":"宮崎県","municipality_name":"三股町","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[131.180467,31.730593000000002]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":